%% Phase4 / search / MV3-G14b 会话内分类搜索（5 tab）
%% 机器真源: cses-client phase4.manifest.json；Helix im_search_post；Java /search/post；Angular chat-search tabs
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant UI as ChatSearch tabs
  participant P as MessageV3ImGate
  participant T as Tauri im_search_post
  participant H as Helix Tick / search outbound
  participant J as Java search gateway
  participant B as EventSink im:__bus__
  participant S as Angular tab result signal
  UI->>P: searchInChannel(channelId,keyword,type,pageNumber,pageSize)
  P->>T: invoke im_search_post
  T->>H: Tick::Command(im_search_post, req_id)
  H->>J: Effect::Http POST /search/post
  J-->>H: items,total,hasMore
  H->>H: Tick::PortReply(Http Ok) / DTO validation
  H->>B: Effect::Emit im:read:result(req_id,data)
  B->>S: resolve request and update active tab signal
  S->>UI: all / media / link / file / topic tab rendering
  Note over H,B: 查询不写 PostgreSQL 或 SQLite，也不等待 WS；HTTP 状态本身不是可渲染结果
